Guanajuato, en materia de difusión, fomento, investigación, ejecución y
supervisión del deporte, educación física, cultura deportiva y acciones de
atención a la juventud.</span><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="ES-MX">Ttrámites y
servicios:</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>1.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Inscripción de escuelas de inicio
al deporte,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>2.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Servicio de mantenimiento e
infraestructura de unidades deportivas públicas,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>3.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Apoyos de fomento al deporte,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>4.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Fisioterapia y nutrición para
público en general,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>5.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Cursos de verano,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>6.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Renta de instalaciones deportivas,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>7.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Deporte especial para adultos
mayores,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>8.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Activación física escolar y
laboral,</span><br></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="text-indent: -18pt;"><span lang="ES-MX"><span>9.<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><span class="font" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span class="size" style="font-size: 7pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span lang="ES-MX">Parque acuático Ángel Camachos.</span><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="ES-MX">Para más información el ciudadano se puede
comunicar a los teléfonos o acudir a sitió referido en la imagen ilustrativa.</span><br></p><div><br></div>]]></description>
